    "spec": "Write synthesizable SystemVerilog for exactly one module named counter with ports input wire clk, input wire rst, output reg [3:0] count.\nOn each rising edge of clk, synchronously set count to 4'b0000 if rst is high; otherwise increment count by one modulo 16. No other behavior is required.\nReturn only the complete RTL source, without Markdown or explanation. Do not include a testbench, includes, preprocessor directives, file I/O, system tasks, DPI, delays, initial blocks, or additional modules.",
